UPDATE `om_ai_stage` SET `task_id` = 1, `stage_code` = 'ROUND_1_FOUNDATION', `stage_name` = '第1轮：目标、术语和枚举', `status` = 2, `sequence_no` = 3, `progress` = 100, `model_key_id` = NULL, `model_name` = 'qwen3.6-plus', `prompt_resource` = NULL, `input_count` = 27, `output_count` = 1, `token_count` = 0, `duration_ms` = 128331, `summary` = '文本模型已完成第 1 个证据窗口分析。模型分析摘要：本批证据围绕采购订单管理与供应商协同展开。明确依据为流程描述与制度规范中清晰界定的订单状态流转、供应商分类标准及单据统一叫法。证据不足项为物料分类的具体层级与编码规则，因业务方明确暂缓建设，本轮不予提取。\n\n阶段完成：第1轮：目标、术语和枚举', `reasoning_content` = '【文本证据窗口 1】\n【模型推理过程】\nHere\'s a thinking process:\n\n1.  **Analyze User Input:**\n    - **Role:** AI辅助建模 Harness 第1轮：基础候选抽取 (AI-assisted modeling harness, Round 1: Basic Candidate Extraction)\n    - **Language Requirement (Highest Priority):** All natural language (reasoning, analysisProcess, analysisSummary, explanations, judgments, validation conclusions, self-checks) MUST be in Simplified Chinese. NO English sentences for reasoning/explanation/summary/self-check. JSON keys, enum codes, identifiers, model names, untranslatable proper nouns, and direct quotes can be in English. Must check before output.\n    - **Output Format:** Strictly a single valid JSON object. NO markdown, NO extra text.\n    - **JSON Structure:**\n      ```json\n      {\n        \"analysisProcess\": \"...\",\n        \"analysisSummary\": \"...\",\n        \"targets\": [...],\n        \"terms\": [...],\n        \"enumTypes\": [...]\n      }\n      ```\n    - **Content Requirements:**\n      - `analysisProcess`: Detailed, auditable, line-by-line (at least 5 lines, 180+ Chinese chars). Structure: 证据范围、候选识别、排除项、引用校验、完整性检查. Must include evidence block numbers, candidates, keep/exclude reasons, validation conclusions. No hidden reasoning chains.\n      - `analysisSummary`: Brief summary of business theme, clear basis, and insufficient evidence items. No hidden reasoning.\n      - `targets`, `terms`, `enumTypes`: Extracted independently. No objects/attributes/relations in this round.\n      - `targets`: `question`, `questionSource`, `businessScenarios`, `priority` (default 2), `acceptCriterion`, `candidateKey` (\"target:stable_key\"), `evidenceBlockNos`, `confidence`.\n      - `terms`: `stdName`, `enName`, `alias`, `abbr`, `source`, `description`, `candidateKey` (\"term:stable_key\"), `evidenceBlockNos`, `confidence`.\n      - `enumTypes`: `enumName`, `enumType` (lowercase_underscore, semantic, e.g., `order_status`), `candidateKey` (\"enum:stable_key\"), `values` (`enumLabel`, `enumValue`, `enumSort`), `evidenceBlockNos`, `confidence`.\n      - **Validation Rules:** Enum values must be explicitly listed in docs. Leave empty if no evidence for enName, alias, priority, acceptCriterion. Deduplicate by `candidateKey` within the round. `questionSource` and `term.source` must be original text or business rule description, NOT block numbers. `enumType` cannot be empty, must be semantic lowercase_underscore.\n    - **Input Data:** Evidence blocks 1669-1695. Covers procurement business overview, process, objects, system relations, entry rules, interview records, other notes. Mentions: 采购单/订购单/采购订单 (same thing), 供应商 (supplier), 物料 (material), 订单状态 (draft, submitted, approved, cancelled), 供应商分类 (material supplier, service supplier), 物料分类 (not priority), 供应商编码规则 (S+6 digits), etc.\n    - **Pre-existing Index:** Contains many global/project business types. I need to extract *new* candidates based *only* on the provided evidence.\n\n2.  **Extract Candidates (Mental Draft):**\n    - *Targets (Business Goals/Questions):*\n      - Q1: 如何快速追溯采购订单的承接供应商及责任源头？ (Source: 1671, 1692)\n      - Q2: 如何汇总供应商供货明细以支持绩效考核？ (Source: 1682, 1692)\n      - Q3: 如何统计物料被订单使用的频次以支持需求分析？ (Source: 1682, 1692)\n      - I\'ll pick one or two main targets. Let\'s focus on the core one: 追溯订单供应商与责任源头 / 供应商供货汇总与考核 / 物料需求统计. I\'ll combine or pick the most prominent. Actually, the prompt says \"一次输出建模目标、术语和枚举类型及其全部枚举值\". I\'ll list 1-2 targets.\n      - Target 1: 采购订单供应商追溯与责任定位 (question: 如何快速定位每张采购订单的承接供应商及质量责任源头？)\n      - Target 2: 供应商供货汇总与绩效考核 (question: 如何汇总各供应商的供货明细以支持年度绩效考核？)\n    - *Terms (Business Concepts):*\n      - 采购订单 (stdName: 采购订单, alias: 采购单, 订购单, source: 1672/1695, description: 记录采购物资、数量、单价及供应商信息的业务单据)\n      - 供应商 (stdName: 供应商, source: 1672/1675, description: 提供物料或服务的外部组织)\n      - 物料 (stdName: 物料, source: 1678, description: 公司采购的生产物资与办公物资)\n      - 采购明细 (stdName: 采购明细, source: 1678, description: 记录订单中单一物料的购买数量与单价的明细数据)\n    - *EnumTypes (Enumerations):*\n      - 订单状态 (enumName: 订单状态, enumType: order_status, values: 草稿, 已提交, 已审批, 已取消) [Source: 1674]\n      - 供应商分类 (enumName: 供应商分类, enumType: supplier_category, values: 物料供应商, 服务供应商) [Source: 1675]\n      - Note: 物料分类 is explicitly excluded in 1695.\n\n3.  **Structure & Refine according to Constraints:**\n    - `analysisProcess`: Must be detailed, 5+ lines, 180+ chars. Structure: 证据范围、候选识别、排除项、引用校验、完整性检查.\n      - 证据范围：覆盖证据块1669至1695，聚焦采购业务概况、流程、对象定义、录入规范及访谈记录。\n      - 候选识别：从1674提取“订单状态”枚举（草稿、已提交、已审批、已取消）；从1675提取“供应商分类”枚举（物料供应商、服务供应商）；从1672/1695提取“采购订单”术语及别名；从1671/1692提取追溯供应商与考核目标。\n      - 排除项：依据1695明确说明“物料分类”暂不纳入近期建模范围，故排除该分类及相关枚举；未提取对象与关系，因本轮仅要求基础候选。\n      - 引用校验：术语来源直接引用原文“采购单、订购单、采购订单指的是同一个业务单据”；枚举值严格对照1674与1675原文列举，未补充常识；目标问题来源对应1671与1692访谈原话。\n      - 完整性检查：已覆盖本批证据中明确提及的核心业务目标、标准术语及状态/分类枚举，所有字段均按规则填充，无缺失必填项，符合独立抽取要求。\n    - `analysisSummary`: 简要说明业务主题、明确依据、证据不足项。\n      - 业务主题为采购订单管理与供应商协同。明确依据为流程描述与制度规范中清晰界定的订单状态流转、供应商分类标准及单据统一叫法。证据不足项为物料分类的具体层级与编码规则，因业务方明确暂缓建设，本轮不予提取。\n    - `targets`:\n      - `question`: \"如何快速定位每张采购订单的承接供应商及质量责任源头？\"\n      - `questionSource`: \"每张采购单最后到底由哪个供应商承接的，经常要翻纸质单据和多个系统才能查出来，出了质量问题找不到责任源头。\"\n      - `businessScenarios`: \"采购订单追溯、质量责任定位\"\n      - `priority`: 2\n      - `acceptCriterion`: \"\" (no explicit criterion in text)\n      - `candidateKey`: \"target:procurement_supplier_traceability\"\n      - `evidenceBlockNos`: [1671, 1692]\n      - `confidence`: 0.9\n    - `terms`:\n      - 1. `stdName`: \"采购订单\", `enName`: \"\", `alias`: \"采购单,订购单\", `abbr`: \"\", `source`: \"采购单、订购单、采购订单指的是同一个业务单据\", `description`: \"记录采购物资、数量、单价及供应商信息的业务单据\", `candidateKey`: \"term:purchase_order\", `evidenceBlockNos`: [1672, 1695], `confidence`: 0.95\n      - 2. `stdName`: \"供应商\", `enName`: \"\", `alias`: \"\", `abbr`: \"\", `source`: \"提供物料或服务的外部组织\", `description`: \"为公司提供生产物资、办公物资或安装维护服务的外部实体\", `candidateKey`: \"term:supplier\", `evidenceBlockNos`: [1672, 1675], `confidence`: 0.95\n      - 3. `stdName`: \"采购明细\", `enName`: \"\", `alias`: \"\", `abbr`: \"\", `source`: \"这张单子里某一种物料买了多少、单价多少\", `description`: \"记录订单中单一物料的购买数量与单价的明细数据\", `candidateKey`: \"term:purchase_detail\", `evidenceBlockNos`: [1678], `confidence`: 0.9\n    - `enumTypes`:\n      - 1. `enumName`: \"订单状态\", `enumType`: \"order_status\", `candidateKey`: \"enum:order_status\", `values`: [{\"enumLabel\":\"草稿\",\"enumValue\":\"draft\",\"enumSort\":1}, {\"enumLabel\":\"已提交\",\"enumValue\":\"submitted\",\"enumSort\":2}, {\"enumLabel\":\"已审批\",\"enumValue\":\"approved\",\"enumSort\":3}, {\"enumLabel\":\"已取消\",\"enumValue\":\"cancelled\",\"enumSort\":4}], `evidenceBlockNos`: [1674], `confidence`: 0.95\n      - 2. `enumName`: \"供应商分类\", `enumType`: \"supplier_category\", `candidateKey`: \"enum:supplier_category\", `values`: [{\"enumLabel\":\"物料供应商\",\"enumValue\":\"material_supplier\",\"enumSort\":1}, {\"enumLabel\":\"服务供应商\",\"enumValue\":\"service_supplier\",\"enumSort\":2}], `evidenceBlockNos`: [1675], `confidence`: 0.95\n\n4.  **Self-Correction & Validation against Constraints:**\n    - *Language:* All natural language in Chinese. Checked. No English sentences in reasoning/analysis.\n    - *JSON Structure:* Matches exactly. `analysisProcess` first.\n    - *analysisProcess:* 5 sections, >180 chars, detailed, auditable. Checked.\n    - *targets/terms/enumTypes:* Independent. No objects/attributes/relations. Checked.\n    - *Validation Rules:*\n      - Enum values explicitly listed? Yes.\n      - Empty fields for missing evidence? Yes (`enName`, `alias` for some, `acceptCriteri